<title>USA: ACC Corp to be added to S&amp;P SmallCap.</title>
<headline>ACC Corp to be added to S&amp;P SmallCap.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>ACC Corp will replace KinderCare Learning Centers Inc in the Standard &amp; Poor's SmallCap 600 Index after the close of trading on February 12, S&amp;P's Equity Services Group said on Monday.</p>
<p>KinderCare is being acquired by Kohlberg Kravis Roberts &amp; Co.</p>
<p>ACC, a telecommunications holding company based in Rochester, New York, will be added to the S&amp;P SmallCap 600 Telecommunications industry group.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
